                "box": {
                    "code": "\r\nrequire(\"evi_counting.genexpr\");\r\n\r\nParam   minimumhz(0.125, min=0, max=1); // minimum zero reset frequency in hz 0..1\nParam   mode(1, min=0, max=1);          // free running or zero reset ? 0/1\nParam   reverse(1, min=0, max=1);       // reverse allowed ? 0/1\nParam   pause(0, min=0, max=1);         // pause current ramp ? 0/1\nParam   phase(0., min=0, max=1);        // set phase on next reset 0..1\n//Param   sync(1, min=0, max=2);\t\t// rate sync, 0=lock, 1=off, 2=cycle    // todo\n\r\n// inputs: Frequency in Hz, Rate Multiplier, Reset\r\n\r\nout1, out2, out3, out4, out5, out6 = eviPhasorRate0(in1, in2, in3,\r\n        minimumhz=minimumhz, mode=mode, reverse=reverse, pause=pause, phase=phase\r\n        );\r\n\r\n// ^^ outs: Phasor Ramp, Rate Ramp, Current Frequency, Current Rate, Phasor Sync, Rate Sync\r\n\r\n",
